{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/extras/Untitled__23_x_6_in___1_.png?t=1745862427\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Terminal Outbreak</i></strong> is a fast paced speed game where you are constantly accelerating forward and can only slow down and move left and right to avoid the obstacle filled levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game thrives on simple controls but hard levels and is focused on players achieving the best times they can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as an Anti Virus on a mission to stop a Super Virus from infecting\u00a0computers worldwide. You will travel through\u00a0Nostalgic Worlds, Tricky  Levels, and Brutal Boss Fights in order to cleanse the internet of this Virus threat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/extras/Untitled_design__10_.png?t=1745862427\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ Levels of Fast Paced, Score Chasing, Speed Running Goodness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Computerized Worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Best Time Leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nostalgic Early 2000's Internet Style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge Obstacles, Launch Into the Air, Teleport Across Levels and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Environments that react and bounce to the Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100+ Death Messages to announce your failures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Minor Dating Sim Elements?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3479820?t=1745862427","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479820/page_